{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":600,"height":360,"color":"4","text":"# SOCIAL → US｜社会 → 我们\n## 三中心总图\n\n中心① WHAT｜社会有什么、我们缺什么\n中心② WHICH/WHEN｜哪些值得吸收、什么时候吸收\n中心③ WHO/VERIFY｜谁负责掌握、怎样证明真的掌握\n\n社会成熟度与我们掌握度分开；百分数仅作导航估值，不是实验准确率。"},
		{"id":"center2","type":"text","x":-1650,"y":-50,"width":620,"height":360,"color":"4","text":"# 中心②｜学习优先级与吸收路线\n## WHICH / WHEN\n\n上一轮 R1–R4 独立保留：\n42项社会知识 → Learning Gap → 14项第一梯队 → 4 Learning Packs → NOW/LATER/ABSORBED/STOP → 防重复造轮子 Gate\n\n状态：RESEARCH DONE → LEARNING / IMPLEMENTATION"},
		{"id":"r1","type":"text","x":-2450,"y":-650,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"# 中心② R1｜42项入口\nC：6\nD：8\nE：12\nF：16\n\nSOCIAL→US 不是知识收藏夹，而是外部知识输入控制器。"},
		{"id":"r2","type":"text","x":-1800,"y":-650,"width":540,"height":340,"color":"6","text":"# 中心② R2｜Learning Gap\nS 社会成熟度 / U 我们掌握度 / G 差值 / R 相关度 / V 学习价值\n\n不是 Gap 越大越先学，而是 Gap × Relevance × 可迁移性 × 当前阻塞。\n总体缺口：E → F → C → D。"},
		{"id":"r3","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-650,"width":540,"height":340,"color":"6","text":"# 中心② R3｜4 Learning Packs\nLEARN-E｜真实评价\nLEARN-F｜可靠生产\nLEARN-C｜意图保持\nLEARN-D｜动态介入\n\n每项必须有：社会知识 → ABSORB/ADAPT → 我们节点 → 最小验证。"},
		{"id":"c","type":"text","x":-2550,"y":500,"width":520,"height":420,"color":"3","text":"# LEARN-C｜P1\nPreference Learning\nControlled Editing / Disentanglement\nMulti-turn Consistency\n\n→ C-INTENT / C-PRESERVE / 119 / 120"},
		{"id":"d","type":"text","x":-1950,"y":500,"width":520,"height":420,"color":"3","text":"# LEARN-D｜P1\nAdjustable Autonomy\nUncertainty Calibration\nEscalation Policy\n\n→ 121 Agency Gate / REVIEW_QUEUE"},
		{"id":"e","type":"text","x":-1350,"y":500,"width":520,"height":430,"color":"3","text":"# LEARN-E｜P0\nConstraint Evaluation\nTrajectory Evaluation\nHuman Preference Evaluation\nBenchmark Design\nLong-horizon Evaluation\n\n→ 122 L1/L2/L3"},
		{"id":"f","type":"text","x":-750,"y":500,"width":520,"height":430,"color":"3","text":"# LEARN-F｜P0\nIdempotency\nObservability\nProvenance / Lineage\n\n→ F-IDEMPOTENCY / OBSERVABILITY / PROVENANCE"},
		{"id":"later","type":"text","x":-2200,"y":1080,"width":500,"height":360,"color":"5","text":"# LATER｜8项\nConstraint Satisfaction\nRisk-sensitive Decision\nProcess Supervision\nFailure Taxonomy\nRecovery Strategy\nSaga / Compensation\nBackpressure\nSLO / Reliability Budget\n\n仅在 NOW 遇到明确阻塞时升级。"},
		{"id":"absorbed","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":1080,"width":500,"height":390,"color":"5","text":"# ABSORBED / IMPLEMENT\nHITL / Approval Gate / Least Privilege / Sandbox / Task-success / Pairwise Ranking基础 / State Machine / Checkpoint / Retry基础 / Scheduling基础 / Versioning / Manifest\n\n成熟方案：实现 + 测试，不重新开理论研究。"},
		{"id":"stop","type":"text","x":-1000,"y":1080,"width":500,"height":340,"color":"1","text":"# STOP / ON-DEMAND\n低优先知识当前不主动投入。\nEvent Sourcing、Circuit Breaker 等在出现明确工程故障时再拉回。"},
		{"id":"gate","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":1580,"width":620,"height":400,"color":"4","text":"# 中心②｜防重复造轮子 Gate\n① 社会≥80且可迁移 → ABSORB\n② 有方案但场景不同 → ADAPT\n③ 社会本身未解决 → RESEARCH\n④ 与C/D/E/F主线弱 → STOP/LATER\n\n执行顺序：E → F → C → D。"},
		{"id":"center3","type":"text","x":1500,"y":-50,"width":650,"height":400,"color":"2","text":"# 中心③｜知识责任与人机验证\n## WHO / VERIFY\n\n第三中心 R1–R3 DONE。\n\nAI_LEARN｜AI/Agent直接掌握并执行\n74_LEARN｜74本人只学到足够做判断与设计\nHUMAN_AI_VALIDATE｜涉及74真实意图/偏好或关键可靠性的能力，必须验证\n\n第二中心回答‘学哪些/何时学’；第三中心回答‘谁学/怎么证明’。两者禁止混层。"},
		{"id":"c3_r1","type":"text","x":850,"y":-700,"width":580,"height":420,"color":"6","text":"# 中心③ R1｜42项责任分层\n\nAI_LEARN：最大层，尤其 F 工程知识大量交给 AI。\n74_LEARN：主要集中 C/D/E，学习会影响创作决策与研究判断的知识。\nHUMAN_AI_VALIDATE：AI声称理解74、保持一致、知道何时介入等能力必须拿真实行为验证。\n\n一项知识允许同时属于多个层。"},
		{"id":"c3_r2","type":"text","x":2200,"y":-700,"width":600,"height":440,"color":"6","text":"# 中心③ R2｜三层完成协议\n\nAI_LEARN DONE：SOURCE → EXTRACT → TRANSLATE → IMPLEMENT → TEST → REGISTER\n\n74_LEARN DONE：默认 L2–L3\nL2 能判断何时使用；L3 能决定怎样进入自己的系统。无需默认学到专业实现 L4。\n\nHUMAN_AI_VALIDATE DONE：FREEZE → PREDICT → EXECUTE → HUMAN JUDGE → COMPARE → LOG"},
		{"id":"ai_learn","type":"text","x":700,"y":500,"width":600,"height":560,"color":"3","text":"# AI_LEARN｜AI直接掌握\n\n重点：F 工程能力 + 可自动化执行知识。\n例如：Workflow Orchestration / State Machine / Checkpoint / Retry / Recovery / Idempotency / Saga / Observability / Provenance / Backpressure / Scheduling / Manifest。\n\n规则：AI说‘理解了’= 不算。\n必须转成规则/代码/Agent行为并通过测试，才标 AI_LEARNED。\n\n74只需知道它解决什么生产问题，不承担专业实现学习。"},
		{"id":"user_learn","type":"text","x":1450,"y":500,"width":600,"height":560,"color":"3","text":"# 74_LEARN｜74本人需要掌握\n\n重点集中 C/D/E：\nPreference Learning\nConstraint Conflict Resolution\nMulti-turn Consistency\nAdjustable Autonomy\nHuman Preference Evaluation\nBenchmark Design\nInter-rater Reliability\n\n学习深度默认 L2–L3：\n理解用途 → 能判断是否该用 → 能设计怎样嫁接自己的系统。\n\n不要求为了动画生产学习完整底层算法或工程实现。"},
		{"id":"human_ai_validate","type":"text","x":2200,"y":500,"width":650,"height":620,"color":"2","text":"# HUMAN_AI_VALIDATE｜74 × AI验证\n\n高优先：\nPreference Learning → AI预测74选择 vs 真实选择\nControlled Editing → 允许改A，检查B/C/D漂移\nMulti-turn Consistency → 连改5–10轮测累计漂移\n121 Agency → False Escalation + Missed Escalation\n122 Intent Fidelity → AI预测接受/重改/否决 vs 74真实判断\nLong-horizon → 测长任务质量衰减\n\n工程能力如 Idempotency / Recovery / Provenance 优先机器故障测试；只有74是 ground truth 的问题才占用74审核时间。"},
		{"id":"machine_verify","type":"text","x":900,"y":1280,"width":600,"height":390,"color":"5","text":"# MACHINE_VERIFY｜优先机器验\nIdempotency：重复执行无重复副作用\nRecovery：强制中断后正确恢复\nProvenance：随机资产可反查生产链\nManifest/Hash：版本与字节一致\nBackpressure：过载时不失控\n\n原则：机器能客观验证的，不占74注意力。"},
		{"id":"human_gt","type":"text","x":1750,"y":1280,"width":650,"height":400,"color":"5","text":"# 74_GROUND_TRUTH｜必须找74\n审美接受/否决\n隐性创作意图\n偏好预测\n是否值得介入\n角色/场景/风格的非目标漂移\n\n原则：只有机器无法替代74作为 ground truth 时，才进入人工审核。"},
		{"id":"c3_gate","type":"text","x":1450,"y":1820,"width":720,"height":450,"color":"4","text":"# 中心③｜知识责任 Gate\n\n1. 能由 AI 学并客观测试？ → AI_LEARN + MACHINE_VERIFY\n2. 会影响74的创作/研究决策？ → 74_LEARN，默认只到L2–L3\n3. AI能力声明涉及74真实意图/偏好？ → HUMAN_AI_VALIDATE\n4. 客观工程指标机器能验证？ → 不找74\n5. 只有74能提供 ground truth？ → 才进入74审核\n\n目标：AI承担专业知识和实现；74只承担不可替代的判断。"}
	],
